        "Class is boring"
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "Class is about to end soon",
      "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
      "nativeLanguage": "en-US"
    },
    {
      "id": "ex_zh_fut_7",
      "type": "multipleChoice",
      "question": "Which phrase indicates an imminent future action (\"about to happen / going to\") in Chinese?",
      "options": [
        "快要...了 (kuài yào... le)",
